<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="/fr/">LayerPorter</a>
    <div class="site-header-right">
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main">
        <a href="/convert/">Outils en ligne</a>
        <a href="/fr/extensions/" aria-current="page">Extensions</a>
        <a href="/guides/">Guides</a>
      </nav>
      <span class="local-pill"><span class="local-pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Traitement local</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
<div class="extensions-hub">
<section class="extensions-hero">
  <span class="extensions-kicker">Extensions Chrome</span>
  <h1>Extensions Chrome pour télécharger et convertir des images</h1>
  <p>Deux outils ciblés. Téléchargez des médias depuis Pinterest ou choisissez une image sur un site ou votre ordinateur et enregistrez-la dans le format voulu.</p>
</section>
<section class="extensions-grid" aria-label="Extensions Chrome">
<article class="extension-product">
  <div class="extension-product-visual pinterest" aria-label="Télécharger Pinterest">
    <div class="ux-window">
      <div class="ux-window-head">
        <div class="ux-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="ux-url">pinterest.com / board / references</div>
        <div class="ux-extension-icon"><img src="/pinterest-downloader/icon-128.png" alt="" width="21" height="21" decoding="async" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pd-workspace">
        <div class="pd-page">
          <div class="pd-page-head"><b>Pinterest</b><span>Tableau</span></div>
          <div class="pd-pins">
            <div class="pd-pin tall"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/fashion-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/travel-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin"><img src="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/workspace-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="214" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin tall"><img src="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/fashion-board-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pd-panel">
          <div class="pd-entry">
            <div class="pd-web-card"><span class="pd-web-icon">←</span><span class="pd-web-copy"><b>Choisir une image ou une vidéo</b><small>Cliquez sur une image ou une vidéo de la page</small></span><span class="pd-web-go">◎</span></div>
            <div class="pd-web-card"><span class="pd-web-icon">▦</span><span class="pd-web-copy"><b>Trouver toutes les images de cette page</b><small>Analyser la page, les frames et les images chargées à la demande</small></span><span class="pd-web-go">→</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-bulk">
            <div class="pd-bulk-head"><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">←</button><div class="pd-bulk-title"><b>Images de la page</b><small>24 images trouvées</small></div><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">↻</button><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">≡</button></div>
            <div class="pd-bulk-actions"><span>Tout sélectionner</span><span>Effacer</span><span>6 sélectionnées</span></div>
            <div class="pd-bulk-grid">
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="214" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pd-download-bar">
              <div class="pd-download-row"><div class="pd-save"><label>Enregistrer sous</label><select class="pd-select" tabindex="-1"><option>Original</option></select></div><div class="pd-download-split"><button class="pd-download-main" type="button" tabindex="-1">Télécharger</button><button class="pd-download-more" type="button" tabindex="-1">⌄</button></div></div>
              <div class="pd-download-meta">Télécharger dans un dossier · Créer un ZIP</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="extension-product-copy">
    <div class="extension-product-top"><div class="extension-product-name">Télécharger Pinterest</div><span class="extension-live">Chrome</span></div>
    <p>Téléchargez des vidéos, images et GIF Pinterest depuis la page ouverte. Choisissez un fichier ou analysez la page, sélectionnez plusieurs résultats et enregistrez-les séparément ou en ZIP.</p>
    <div class="extension-features"><span class="extension-feature">Un fichier</span><span class="extension-feature">Analyser la page</span><span class="extension-feature">Sélection multiple</span><span class="extension-feature">Original</span><span class="extension-feature">ZIP</span></div>
    <div class="extension-actions">
      <a class="extension-btn primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/pinterest-downloader/nmpahchhmcdejmfcmkphnbhckmlhhnon?utm_source=layerporter&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=extensions_hub_fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ajouter à Chrome ↗</a>
      <a class="extension-btn secondary" href="/fr/pinterest-downloader/">Voir les détails →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="extension-product">
  <div class="extension-product-visual converter" aria-label="Convertisseur d'images">
    <div class="ux-window">
      <div class="ux-window-head"><div class="ux-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="ux-url">example.com / product-image.webp</div><div class="ux-extension-icon"><img src="/picture-converter/welcome/picture-converter-icon.png" alt="" width="21" height="21" decoding="async" /></div></div>
      <div class="pc-workspace">
        <div class="pc-source-card"><span class="pc-source-arrow">←</span><span class="pc-source-copy"><b>Choisir une image sur un site web</b><small>Importer une image depuis la page actuelle</small></span><span class="pc-source-icon"><img src="/picture-converter/welcome/picture-converter-icon.png" alt="" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" /></span></div>
        <div class="pc-main">
          <div class="pc-stage"><div class="pc-gallery-icon">▧</div><strong>Glissez-déposez une image ici</strong><p>ou choisissez un fichier sur votre ordinateur</p><button class="pc-choose" type="button" tabindex="-1">Choisir une image</button><div class="pc-formats-title">Formats d’entrée pris en charge</div><div class="pc-inputs"><span>PNG</span><span>JPG</span><span>WebP</span><span>HEIC</span><span>AVIF</span><span>GIF</span><span>BMP</span><span>JFIF</span><span>SVG</span><span>+1</span></div></div>
          <div class="pc-settings">
            <div class="pc-output-formats"><span class="pc-format active">PNG ✓</span><span class="pc-format">JPG</span><span class="pc-format">WEBP</span><span class="pc-format">PDF</span><span class="pc-format">ICO</span></div>
            <div class="pc-option"><div class="pc-option-row"><span>Qualité</span><span>92%</span></div><div class="pc-range"></div></div>
            <button class="pc-download" type="button" tabindex="-1">↓ Télécharger PNG</button>
            <div class="pc-summary"><b>Entrée</b> WebP · 1600×1200<br /><b>Sortie</b> PNG · 1600×1200</div>
            <div class="pc-local">Traitement local. Aucun fichier n’est envoyé.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="extension-product-copy">
    <div class="extension-product-top"><div class="extension-product-name">Convertisseur d'images</div><span class="extension-live">Chrome</span></div>
    <p>Choisissez une image sur un site web ou ouvrez un fichier local, puis enregistrez le résultat en PNG, JPG, WebP, PDF ou ICO. Les fichiers locaux sont traités sur votre appareil.</p>
    <div class="extension-features"><span class="extension-feature">Depuis un site</span><span class="extension-feature">Depuis l’ordinateur</span><span class="extension-feature">PNG / JPG / WebP</span><span class="extension-feature">PDF / ICO</span><span class="extension-feature">Local</span></div>
    <div class="extension-actions">
      <a class="extension-btn primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/image-converter/ooiklbnjmhbcfnllkgjahadblibecgfj?utm_source=layerporter&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=extensions_hub_fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ajouter à Chrome ↗</a>
      <a class="extension-btn secondary" href="/picture-converter/">Voir les détails →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
</section>
<p class="extensions-note">Chaque extension dispose de sa propre page avec toutes les fonctions et les principaux usages.</p>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><p>LayerPorter — extensions de navigateur et outils en ligne</p><nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Footer"><a href="/about/">À propos</a><span>·</span><a href="/fr/extensions/">Extensions</a><span>·</span><a href="/privacy/">Confidentialité</a><span>·</span><a href="/terms/">Conditions</a></nav></div></footer>
</body>
</html>